-<h1 class="article-headline">Buffalo Louie's <em>and Why It Matters</em></h1>
+<h1 class="article-headline">BuffaLouie's <em>and Why It Matters</em></h1>
 <p class="article-deck">Some places exist and some places mean something. This is the difference between a bar and a place you remember. Not every room earns its own mythology.</p>
 <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:.5rem"><img src="images/sean-matthews-avatar.jpg" alt="Sean Matthews" style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:2px solid #cc0000;flex-shrink:0"><p class="article-meta" style="margin:0">Words by Sean Matthews · Circle City · One Man's Opinion</p></div>
